Now the carry-out. The carry occurs when at least two of the three inputs are 1. So how to calculate that. Well, the carry-out is 1 if any two of a, b, or cin are 1. So I can compute it as (a & b) | (a & cin) | (b & cin). That way, if any two are 1, the carry is 1.

